    summary: "Adrian Ochsenbein is Chief Physician of Medical Oncology at Inselspital, Bern University Hospital, and a Director of the University Cancer Center Inselspital. His translational research investigates leukaemia stem cells and immune regulation, leading to the clinical development of the anti-CD70 antibody cusatuzumab in acute myeloid leukaemia. He combines a large clinical department with a laboratory programme in tumour immunology.",
