    summary: "Konstanze Döhner is President of the European Hematology Association (EHA) and a professor of haematology at Ulm University, Germany. Her research focuses on the molecular genetics of acute myeloid leukaemia and its translation into risk stratification and therapy. She is a co-author of the European LeukemiaNet recommendations for the diagnosis and management of AML.",
