    summary: "Joaquín Martínez-López is Head of the Haematology Department at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid and heads the H12O-CNIO Haematological Malignancies Clinical Research Unit. His research centres on multiple myeloma, including minimal residual disease assessment and novel therapies. He is a professor at the Complutense University of Madrid.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Institution profile", url: "https://www.cnio.es/en/the-cnio/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=Martinez-Lopez+J%5BAuthor%5D+myeloma" }],
