    tldr: "Genome biologist who chairs UMC Utrecht's Strategic Program Cancer, the umbrella for more than 800 cancer researchers in Utrecht.",
    summary: "Wouter de Laat is Chair of the Strategic Program Cancer at UMC Utrecht, which coordinates cancer research across the UMC Utrecht Cancer Center and the Hubrecht Institute. He is a professor of biomedical genomics whose laboratory pioneered chromosome conformation capture (4C) methods to study three-dimensional genome organisation. His work links chromatin structure to gene regulation and disease.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Institution profile", url: "https://research.umcutrecht.nl/strategic-programs/cancer/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=de+Laat+W%5BAuthor%5D" }],
