    tldr: "Utrecht haematologist and immunotherapy researcher on the daily board of UMC Utrecht's cancer programme, known for gamma-delta T cell receptor-engineered cell therapies.",
    summary: "Jürgen Kuball is Professor of Haematology at UMC Utrecht and a member of the Daily Board of its Strategic Program Cancer. He leads the haematology department and a translational research group developing gamma-delta T cell receptor-based cellular immunotherapies for haematological and solid cancers. His work spans allogeneic stem cell transplantation and engineered T cell products.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Institution profile", url: "https://research.umcutrecht.nl/strategic-programs/cancer/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=Kuball+J%5BAuthor%5D" }],
