    tldr: "Haematologist who presides over GIMEMA, Italy's adult haematological malignancies cooperative group, and co-authored its chemotherapy-free Ph+ ALL trial.",
    summary: "Marco Vignetti is President of Fondazione GIMEMA (Gruppo Italiano Malattie Ematologiche dell'Adulto), the Italian cooperative group that runs multicentre trials in adult haematological malignancies. He has co-authored landmark GIMEMA studies including the dasatinib-blinatumomab trial in Philadelphia-positive acute lymphoblastic leukaemia and the description of NPM1 mutations in normal-karyotype AML.",
