    summary: "Hien Le is President Elect of TROG Cancer Research and chairs its Scientific Committee, which oversees the group's radiotherapy trial portfolio. A professor and radiation oncologist based in Adelaide, his interests include clinical trials of advanced radiotherapy techniques including proton therapy. His roles are listed on TROG's board page.",
