    tldr: "Paediatric oncologist and palliative care physician serving as Interim Director of Texas Children's Cancer and Hematology Center.",
    summary: "Tammy Kang, MD, is Interim Director of Texas Children's Cancer and Hematology Center in Houston, one of the largest paediatric cancer and blood disorders programmes in the United States and affiliated with Baylor College of Medicine. Her background is in paediatric oncology and paediatric palliative care, with research on symptom management and quality of care for children with cancer. Her role is listed on the center's leadership page.",
