    summary: "Mafalda Oliveira is President of SOLTI Cancer Research Group, the Spanish academic cooperative group focused on breast cancer clinical and translational research. A medical oncologist at Vall d'Hebron University Hospital and Vall d'Hebron Institute of Oncology in Barcelona, she has been an investigator on major trials of novel endocrine and targeted agents in hormone receptor-positive breast cancer, including CAPItello-291 and SERENA-2. Her role is listed on SOLTI's board page.",
