    tldr: "Madrid breast oncologist and Vice President of the SOLTI breast cancer research group.",
    summary: "Eva Ciruelos is Vice President of SOLTI Cancer Research Group and a medical oncologist leading the breast cancer unit at Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid. She has been an investigator on numerous SOLTI and international breast cancer trials spanning HER2-positive, hormone receptor-positive and triple-negative disease. Her role is listed on SOLTI's board page.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Society page", url: "https://www.gruposolti.org/junta-directiva/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=Ciruelos+E%5BAuthor%5D" }],
