    tldr: "Cardiac surgeon and former IDF field hospital commander who serves as Director General of Shaare Zedek Medical Center in Jerusalem.",
    summary: "Ofer Merin is Director General of Shaare Zedek Medical Center, a major Jerusalem teaching hospital that was the first in Israel to integrate oncology and palliative medicine services. A cardiothoracic surgeon, he previously commanded the Israel Defense Forces field hospital deployed to international disasters. His role is recorded in the public record for the institution.",
