    tldr: "Paediatric oncologist from University Hospital Essen who presides over SIOP Europe and has led international Ewing sarcoma trials.",
    summary: "Uta Dirksen is President of SIOP Europe, the European Society for Paediatric Oncology, and a paediatric oncologist at University Hospital Essen, Germany. She has coordinated cooperative bone sarcoma trials including the Ewing 2008 and iEuroEwing studies, and works on adolescent and young adult cancer care and European paediatric oncology policy.",
    profiles: [{ label: "Society page", url: "https://siope.eu/about-siope/board/" }, { label: "PubMed", url: "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=Dirksen+U%5BAuthor%5D" }],
