    summary: "Boubou Hallberg is Hospital Director and Chief Executive Officer of Sahlgrenska University Hospital in Gothenburg, Sweden. The hospital, together with the University of Gothenburg's Sahlgrenska Center for Cancer Research, forms a major Nordic cancer care and research environment. Hallberg is a paediatrician by training and leads the hospital's executive management team.",
