    tldr: "Neurologist who directs PGIMER Chandigarh, one of India's leading public tertiary-care and research institutes with a large oncology service.",
    summary: "Prof. Vivek Lal is Director of the Postgraduate Institute of Medical Education and Research (PGIMER), Chandigarh, according to public records. He is a neurologist with a research interest in neuro-ophthalmology and headache disorders. PGIMER is a national institute of importance whose departments of radiotherapy, medical oncology and haematology serve northern India.",
