    summary: "Jin Seok Ahn (안진석) is the 14th President of the Korean Cancer Study Group (KCSG), the multicentre cooperative group that runs investigator-initiated cancer trials across Korea. He is a medical oncologist at Samsung Medical Center, Sungkyunkwan University, whose clinical research centres on lung cancer, including targeted and immune-based therapies.",
